  "translation": "Today is Saturday. Xiao Ming gets up at seven in the morning. He first washes his face in the room. Then he eats breakfast. He eats two buns and a cup of milk. Before breakfast, he calls his mom. He asks, 'Mom, are you going to the supermarket today?' Mom says, 'No, I want to rest at home.' Xiao Ming says, 'I can go to the supermarket.' He goes to the supermarket alone. He buys three apples and a piece of cake. After returning home, he reads a book. He is very happy."
